{"ID":"20240118151251-n8rtsi8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151251-n8rtsi8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151251-n8rtsi8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151251-kzsd8i8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130092617-alylmef\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130092617-alylmef\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"100酸枣（酸枣仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130092617"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151251-kzsd8i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151251-kzsd8i8","updated":"20240122104504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸平，主心腹寒热，邪结气聚，四肢酸疼，湿痹，久服安五脏，轻身延年。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104508-wic0cpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104508-wic0cpt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国山西河南等地，多生山野间，或作棘实，，乃棘树之实也，实之大者名酸枣仁，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104510-jqdz0ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104510-jqdz0ca"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味酸，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104511-i9f9xfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104511-i9f9xfd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】酸枣仁为宁心敛汗要药，主心腹寒热，邪结气聚，烦心不眠，虚汗烦渴，治四肢酸痛湿痹，益肝养筋。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104513-p9glxw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104513-p9glxw9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】烦心不得眠，脐上下痛，血转久泄，虚汗烦渴，补中益肝气，坚筋骨，助阴气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104514-dl09uwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104514-dl09uwl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】筋骨风，炒仁研汤服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104516-6vwmws3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104516-6vwmws3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治胸膈烦躁，不能眠也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104521-gq8hnio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104521-gq8hnio"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104522-qv7fqse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104522-qv7fqse"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡肝胆心脾有实邪热者，禁用，以收敛故也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122104525-680vrkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104525-680vrkq"}},{"ID":"20240122104526-swbj969","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104526-swbj969"}},{"ID":"20240122104526-m11pi6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104526-m11pi6p","updated":"20240130092515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第100味药，酸枣，当然我们现在叫酸枣仁，这些呢，大的子，果实大的我们叫酸枣仁，入药，酸枣仁呢，为什么叫酸？因为它的味道是酸的，你看到仁剂，那就知道如果你多吃就会下利，因为里面有油，那这个药因为味道是酸的，酸的是它有收敛的功能。所以一个人表虚，如果是发汗不止，或者是心情，这个心理面这个很急躁，我们可以收敛。烦心我们可以收敛的时候，当你看到这个病人需要收敛的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122104527-tcqipv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122104527-tcqipv3","updated":"20240130092543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸味的药都是收敛的药，所以虚烦不得眠，我们酸枣仁汤也是治疗失眠很好的一个方剂，酸枣仁汤。因为它入肝嘛，酸味入肝，所以说能够滋肝养筋，抽筋啊什么，能够滋肝养筋。它的禁忌，因为它是主收敛，所以当你再用攻下排的时候，不要用酸枣仁，因为它是收敛嘛。有实邪热者，比如说正在发肝炎，全身发黄，正在清热的时候，你就不要去开那个酸枣仁，剂量呢，一钱三钱四钱都没有关系，酸枣仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240130092617-alylmef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130092617-alylmef"}}]}